--- !u!114 &526914974
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 526914972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: (You violently hang up on the PDA and call the number back with your phone)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: 
  - text: "Torch, there\u2019s been a new development on the Vault, and I think it
      might be bad news. I need you to pick up your sword and describe it to me"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: My katana? Why? What do you want?
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: "It\u2019s kind of a lot to explain. Just pick it up and describe its dope
      awesomeness to me."
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: Ah the M-M-Mystery Sword... Little is known. But legend says it has a blade
      that glows an unearthly blue
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "There\u2019s also real gold on the sheath"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: What about the hilt? Is that gold too?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Um, yeah. Hey, how do you know so much about my \u2013"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: Look really closely at the blade, tell me what you see
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "Holes. Lots of tiny little holes. Man, way to ruin my fun, Storm. Now
      I know my sword\u2019s DEFECTIVE\u2026"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "It\u2019s not defective \u2013 it used to belong to my dad's grandmaster,
      long ago! Those holes are supposed to allow your CHI to seep in\u2026 to perform
      a special move called the TAI CHI TELEPORT"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "Man, that\u2019s wack.. Do you know how many times i've tried to do the
      teleport and wound up in the middle of nowhere? Last time I had to walk for
      two hours before I saw any sign of civilization\u2026 And all I needed was
      my sword?"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Yeah. The Spartan dojo wants your sword for themselves. They dug a tunnel
      straight to our Vault trying to steal my sword, so who knows what they\u2019d
      do for yours"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "We also have a bit of a problem inside the Vault\u2026 I mean, our sword
      has been seeping out some sort of radiation\u2026 it\u2019s getting worse as
      we get closer to the solstice, and we need yours to\u2026 Well, anyway\u2026
      You should give it to me tomorrow night so I can lock it up in the Vault"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Don\u2019t you think it would be a bad idea to keep both swords in the
      same place?"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Do you have a better idea?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1636089571}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (Suddenly the PDA rings. It's THAD! You contemplate answering both at the
      same time, but you think things would get a little complicated. You reluctantly
      set Storm down and answer the PDA)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "Thad?! Please tell me this isn\u2019t about some sword\u2026"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "Wait\u2026 You know about the Sword?"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 862996129}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "The one I\u2019m looking at right now?"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: DID YOU STEAL IT FROM THE VAULT?!?!
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 862996129}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "No, of course not! I wouldn\u2019t steal the\u2014"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I DON\u2019T UNDERSTAAAAAAnnnNNNDDD!!!"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 862996129}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: (The ear-demolishing scream temporarily fries the connection. During that
      time, you assume he was trying to recount all the strange things that happened
      last night. You yell something about there being two swords, hoping it got
      through to the other end. Suddenly you can hear him again.)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "Yeah, bottom line is, we want you to help us break into the vault at midnight.
      With you on our team, it\u2019d be 3 vs 3"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 862996129}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "Thad, I've meaning to tell you this for awhile now, but I\u2019ve been
      involved with the Insiders for three years now... I'm like... Their analyst,
      the Q to their James Bond.. I\u2019m not just gonna turn on them like that."
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: But you have a weapon that lets you teleport just about anywhere! Did they
      ever let you see inside the vault, Torch?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 862996129}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "They say it\u2019s gonna cause the apocalypse \u2013 is there no better
      lie to keep people out? There is something big inside that vault, Torch. Bigger
      than just the sword. Spartan Jack and I are finally going to find out for ourselves."
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 862996129}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Thad hangs up. You are conflicted \u2013 his logic made a little bit of
      sense, in that conspiracy sort of way. It could all be a cover up. But if so,
      would the ninjas ever let you see?"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "One thing is for sure: Whoever\u2019s side you take, you are getting into
      that Vault. It also seems like a good idea to keep the sword away from Thad,
      so that he doesn\u2019t go crazy from the power"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "What if it turns his 4-pack into a 6-pack? There would be no containing
      his ego. Any way you slice it, there\u2019s going to be a major battle tonight."
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: 'New Quest: Sleep'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
